[04:00:35.362] INFO (97684): request completed {"reqId":"req-1","res":{"statusCode":404},"responseTime":7.467559814453125}
[04:00:36.355] INFO (97684): finished serialization here .. 2022 {"reqId":"req-1"}
```

... if i remove the timeout/promise from the preSerialization hook .. it would "work". (happy timing-issue :) )

### Expected Behavior

`reply.send()` should completely interrupt the lifecycle.

